{"supplier":"travelport","supplierHotelId":"BW:39781","name":"Best Western Plus Khan Hotel","description":"Experience breathtaking views of the Mediterranean Sea at this Antalya, Turkey hotel, close to many historical sites and beautiful waterfalls. The Best Western Plus Khan Hotel is located in the Antalya, Turkey city center, only a short distance from Antalya International Airport. A short walk from this completely renovated hotel, guests will find themselves in historic Old Antalya, surrounded by modern businesses and eclectic shopping opportunities. Come experience historical Antalya Castle and other ancient architecture that intermingle with Antalya's modern buildings. Nearby Konyaalti Beach offers guests resort-style attractions and breathtaking sunny shores. Outdoor activities nearby include white water rafting, winter sports, hiking stunning waterfalls, and exploring archeological ruins. Our Mediterranean Sea hotel offers guests the most comfortable of accommodations. Our cheerful, reliable staff will ensure the newly remodeled rooms and amenities please guests of all ages. Relax and unwind by our outdoor pool and sundeck, or spend time in our on-site game room. Our rooms offer all the comforts of home, including cable television and telephone. Come experience the beauty of Antalya, Turkey and the Mediterranean region at the Best Western Plus Khan Hotel. Enjoy your stay.","address":"Kazim Ozalp Cad. No.55 Antalya, Antalya, TR, 07040, Turkiye","city":"Antalya","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"07040","lat":36.8887,"lng":30.70417,"stars":3,"chain":"BW","phone":"242-2483870","email":"info@khanhotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://media.iceportal.com/47661/photos/94791306_L.jpg","order":0,"category":"room","caption":"Guest Room,On-Site"},{"url":"https://media.iceportal.com/47661/photos/94791398_L.jpg","order":1,"category":"room","caption":"Guest Room,On-Site"},{"url":"https://media.iceportal.com/47661/photos/94791386_L.jpg","order":2,"category":"room","caption":"